  "important": [
    "IMPORTANT: Mail replacement information within 10 calendar days.",
    "IMPORTANT: For New York contract state cases, the F5500 and Sales Illustration Certification requirements that build in WinRisk can be canceled, The F5500NY is no longer acceptable or required for New York cases."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "NOTE: Effective 8/15/2024, all life applications must have a signed and dated matching Preliminary Information Sales Presentation (illustration) submitted with the application signed on or before the date of the part 1 application. If not received at initial review, the part 1 must be resigned and redated. This requirement is in compliance with NY Regulations."
